sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as ONE Admin
    participant Gym
    participant Agent
    participant Chain as Sui (HONBU pkg)
    participant PG as Postgres (PII)
    participant W as Walrus

    Admin->>Chain: create_agent_cap(agent_addr)
    Admin->>Chain: create_gym(name, gym_owner)
    Chain-->>Gym: GymCap

    Agent->>PG: store passport/visa
    PG-->>Agent: user_hash
    Agent->>W: upload profile.jpg
    W-->>Agent: blob_id
    Agent->>Chain: register_fighter(user_hash, blob_id, ...)

    Gym->>Chain: create_slot(start_ms, capacity)
    Chain-->>Chain: TrainingSlot (shared)

    Agent->>Chain: book_slot(AgentCap, Fighter, Slot)
    Note over Chain: atomic: slot.booked_count++,<br/>mint Booking + Receipt
    Chain-->>Agent: BookingReceipt

    alt 24h+ before slot
        Agent->>Chain: cancel_booking(Receipt, Booking, Slot)
    else < 24h
        Chain-->>Agent: abort ECancelWindowClosed
    end

    Note over Gym,Chain: after slot.start_ms + duration
    Gym->>Chain: mark_completed(Booking, Slot)
